direction: down
tasks: Fixed task set
h0: Harness v1.0
h1: Harness v1.1
g0: Grader v1.0
g1: Grader v1.1
s0: Pass rate per task
s1: Pass rate per task
z: Delta vs noise
verdict: Real change or noise
tasks -> h0: same tasks, N runs
tasks -> h1: same tasks, N runs
h0 -> g0: transcripts
h1 -> g1: transcripts
g0 -> s0: pass/fail
g1 -> s1: pass/fail
s0 -> z
s1 -> z
z -> verdict: abs(z) >= 2
